        <p>06 · PLAN I · 统计拆分与表示诊断</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" width="840" height="52">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="30" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25">
        <p>I · 把"句界效应"拆成统计路径与表示路径</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="60" startY="124" endX="900" endY="124">
      <border color="rgba(42,45,48,0.2)" width="1"/>
    </line>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="144" width="390" height="30">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">
        <p>做了什么 · 怎么做</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="186" width="390" height="270">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.55">
        <p><span bold="true">① 统计公式</span>：检测量 <formula><latex>z=(G-\lambda N)/\sqrt{N\lambda(1-\lambda)}</latex></formula>，默认 λ=.25 时单单元上限 <formula><latex>\sqrt{3}\approx 1.732 &lt; 2.33</latex></formula>，N=1 的逃逸有确定统计解释</p>
        <p><span bold="true">② 代数反事实</span>：仅替换句数、保留原命中率可使 21/30 低于阈值；保留句数、替换 green-rate 可使 30/30 低于阈值——只描述数值充分性，不识别真实因果</p>
        <p><span bold="true">③ 图组合诊断 D(g1,g2)</span>：把两个已保存句级图挂在人工 multi-sentence 根下，与同一固定模板库算 S2Match</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="140" width="430" height="30">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">
        <p>结果：候选图扩大后局部模板得分被稀释</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="180" width="200" height="60">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="36" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false">
        <p>108 → 0</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="244" width="200" height="40">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
        <p>注入时已接受目标中 green 目标数</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="690" topLeftY="180" width="210" height="60">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="36" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false">
        <p>0.82→0.45</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="690" topLeftY="244" width="210" height="40">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
        <p>中位 F1：原句级候选图 → 人工组合图</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="292" width="430" height="86">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(110,120,114,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p>真实合句文本重解析图的中位 F1 为 <span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">0.52</span>，在 25/30 文档上相对人工组合图回升。</p>
        <p>本实验是对评分实现与归一化行为的受控诊断，<span bold="true">不是真实攻击 ASR</span>。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="392" width="430" height="2">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(76,122,90,1)"/></fill>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="470" topLeftY="404" width="430" height="70">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)">启发 → 下一步</span></p>
        <p>统计路径（N 减少）与表示路径（图作用域稀释）分开成立；真实攻击中 parser 变化、图作用域、归一化各自的贡献尚未识别 → 进入 J 用强基线与跨水印界定适用范围</p>
      </content>
